<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sola Int'l cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sola Int'l cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Sola International Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Sola posted fourth quarter earnings of $0.55 a share, compared with $0.53 a share last year.</p>
</text>
